# Vulnerabilities the image scan accepts for a short, recorded time
# (.github/workflows/image.yml passes this file to Trivy with --ignorefile).
#
# Empty unless a fixable HIGH or CRITICAL vulnerability blocks every deploy and
# cannot be fixed forward soon: docs/operations.md, "The image scan blocks a
# deploy". Each entry is one ID with an expiry date, preceded by a comment with
# the date, who reviewed it, and why the vulnerable code is not reachable in
# the API:
#
#   # 2026-11-02 owner: libfoo in the base image; the API never calls it; fixed in 1.2.4
#   CVE-2026-12345 exp:2026-12-02
#
# Trivy stops ignoring an entry on its expiry date. The expiry is at most 31
# days out (tests/deploy/test_infra_review_r2.py); remove the entry with the fix.
